OL,3,GNEWSANHS wait woman 'would have died if
OL,4,Awe did not act'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of delays across the NHS
OL,7,Fnearly cost a woman her life after her
OL,8,Fcolon burst and she developed
OL,9,Fsepticaemia, her husband says.
OL,11,FAndrew Jones and his wife Diane phoned
OL,12,F999 twice before driving to Derriford
OL,13,FHospital in Plymouth, Devon - 24 miles
OL,14,F(39km) from their home near Launceston
OL,15,Fin Cornwall. However, they had to wait
OL,16,Ffor hours as her condition worsened and
OL,17,Fshe underwent emergency surgery.
OL,19,F"She would have died if we hadn't acted
OL,20,F` there's no doubt about it," Jones
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
