OL,3,GNEWSANHS wait woman 'would have died if
OL,4,Awe did not act'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity Hospitals Plymouth and the
OL,7,FSouth Western Ambulance Service both
OL,8,Fapologised and said they were under
OL,9,F"significant pressure".
